    "created_at": "2016-10-07T17:22:32Z",
    "updated_at": "2016-10-07T17:22:32Z",
    "body": "Note that Gecko has https://bugzilla.mozilla.org/show_bug.cgi?id=1265961 tracking this stuff; right now we simply don't go to the parent of a srcdoc document at all for referrer and referrer policy information....  We've been waiting on there actually existing wpt tests, becuase we would require those to commit the change to our tree anyway, and my attempt to add such tests ended up in the limbo of https://github.com/w3c/web-platform-tests/pull/2851...\n\nAnyway, if we can add testing for both cases (srcdoc has and doesn't have explicit referrer policy), to wpt, that would be quite excellent.  ;)\n",
    "author_association": "CONTRIBUTOR",
