    "created_at": "2016-10-07T17:24:13Z",
    "updated_at": "2016-10-07T17:24:13Z",
    "body": "I just now stumbled upon https://github.com/w3c/web-platform-tests/pull/3700 which looks like it'll cover the srcdoc-doesn't-have-explicit-referrer-policy. I'm hoping @mikewest will merge that soon, then I can add tests for srcdoc-does-have-explicit-referrer-policy (and also dynamic meta tag insertion which @bzbarsky mentioned in https://github.com/w3c/web-platform-tests/pull/3700#issuecomment-247945513).\n",
